pkg:Evidence_v1_27_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.27.0 (comprehensive raw-ID sweep)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: continued verifying the MS-Explorer sidebar fix beyond the two panels the user's screenshot showed, and found the same defect class in 8 further places -- the detail-pane heading in two rendering functions, the reinforces chip generator, a Quick jump widget, two chat-answer templates, and the Copy-as-AI-prompt feature, the last also found to still say 'LC Waikiki' verbatim, a genuine miss from an earlier cleanup pass. All fixed; one further instance confirmed to be dead code (gated on an empty array) and correctly left untouched. Re-verified comprehensively via real Playwright across all tabs plus the actual filter/reset/select interaction: 0 remaining raw-id matches except one legitimate SVG tooltip. Version bumped correctly before committing, applying the version-drift lesson proactively: all 4 stages moved to v1_7_0, Cross.D verified. Re-verified: all Stage1-3 gates PASS fresh, pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "ea9495f18d32835efae3f7f7b6d6bf2ddc1622671a87f6aa1594ba6d77d55aa9"^^xsd:string .
